# F-250 head unit: the demo's CAN units stay off (ADR-0015).
#
# They are masked (stage1-setup.sh step 1, f250-system), but the AGL packages
# ship presets that enable them (/usr/lib/systemd/system-preset/98-*.preset).
# `systemctl preset-all` refuses to enable a masked unit, which fails the
# image build's rootfs step, and it also runs on a first boot. The first
# matching preset wins and 00 sorts first, so these lines win.
disable kuksa-can-provider.service
disable can-dev-helper.service

# oFono, the telephony daemon: connman is built with its 3g option, which
# pulls oFono in. Nothing here uses it; the demo's phone app did.
disable ofono.service
